  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Phillips 66 has $582M in contract obligations in FY2026 to date, across 460 awards, with an average award size of $1.3M. Obligations are down 9.1% year over year. Obligations rose from $329M in FY21 to $479M in FY23, dipped to $443M in FY24, peaked at $640M in FY25, and eased to $582M in FY26. The current-year total is a partial fiscal year figure. The award count and average award size show the program uses many mid-sized awards rather than a handful of very large contracts. That mix can affect administrative burden and opportunity cadence for contractors tracking Phillips 66 work.",
